      "caption": "The stub resolver sends one recursive query to the configured nameserver.",
      "narration": "The stub resolver reads resolv.conf and sends a single recursive query. It does no iteration itself, the recursive resolver does the work.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "h",
          "type": "title",
